      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.00527">arXiv:2505.00527</a>
        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2505.00527">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2505.00527">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2505.00527">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
