        AVA: Towards Agentic Video Analytics with <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yan%2C+Y">Yuxuan Yan</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Jiang%2C+S">Shiqi Jiang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Cao%2C+T">Ting Cao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yang%2C+Y">Yifan Yang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yang%2C+Q">Qianqian Yang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shu%2C+Y">Yuanchao Shu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yang%2C+Y">Yuqing Yang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Qiu%2C+L">Lili Qiu</a>
      
